{"title": "Call for Help", "pageid": 4316, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Call_for_Help", "categories": ["Class actions", "Bugs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Action_Surge.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Action_Surge.webp/300px-Action_Surge.webp, /w/images/f/f4/Action_Surge.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Action_Surge.webp/300px-Action_Surge.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f4/Action_Surge.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Call for Help</b> is an action available to <a href=\"/wiki/Gut\" title=\"Gut\">Gut</a>. She will use this ability to call for reinforcements if she has relocated to the <a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Sanctum#Gut's_room\" title=\"Shattered Sanctum\">chapel</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nGut calls for help!<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per combat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per combat</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_GOB_GoblinPriest_CallForHelp</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_GOB_GoblinPriest_CallForHelp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_GOB_GoblinPriest_CallForHelp\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Gut\" title=\"Gut\">Gut</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The goblins who will respond to the call are:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shekt\" title=\"Shekt\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Portrait_Shekt.png/25px-Portrait_Shekt.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Portrait_Shekt.png/38px-Portrait_Shekt.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Portrait_Shekt.png/50px-Portrait_Shekt.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Booyahg Shekt\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Portrait_Shekt.png/25px-Portrait_Shekt.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Portrait_Shekt.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shekt\" title=\"Shekt\">Booyahg Shekt</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mrak\" title=\"Mrak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Portrait_Mrak.png/25px-Portrait_Mrak.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Portrait_Mrak.png/38px-Portrait_Mrak.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Portrait_Mrak.png/50px-Portrait_Mrak.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Devout Mrak\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Portrait_Mrak.png/25px-Portrait_Mrak.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Portrait_Mrak.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mrak\" title=\"Mrak\">Devout Mrak</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Muzul\" title=\"Muzul\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Portrait_Muzul.png/25px-Portrait_Muzul.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Portrait_Muzul.png/38px-Portrait_Muzul.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Portrait_Muzul.png/50px-Portrait_Muzul.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Devout Muzul\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Portrait_Muzul.png/25px-Portrait_Muzul.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Portrait_Muzul.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Muzul\" title=\"Muzul\">Devout Muzul</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Azak\" title=\"Azak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Azak.png/25px-Portrait_Azak.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Azak.png/38px-Portrait_Azak.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Azak.png/50px-Portrait_Azak.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tracker Azak\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Azak.png/25px-Portrait_Azak.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/Portrait_Azak.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Azak\" title=\"Azak\">Tracker Azak</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tozad\" title=\"Tozad\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Portrait_Tozad.png/25px-Portrait_Tozad.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Portrait_Tozad.png/38px-Portrait_Tozad.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Portrait_Tozad.png/50px-Portrait_Tozad.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tracker Tozad\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Portrait_Tozad.png/25px-Portrait_Tozad.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0f/Portrait_Tozad.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tozad\" title=\"Tozad\">Tracker Tozad</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Greez\" title=\"Greez\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Portrait_Greez.png/25px-Portrait_Greez.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Portrait_Greez.png/38px-Portrait_Greez.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Portrait_Greez.png/50px-Portrait_Greez.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Warlock Greez\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Portrait_Greez.png/25px-Portrait_Greez.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/36/Portrait_Greez.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Greez\" title=\"Greez\">Warlock Greez</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Despite what is shown in the tooltip, this action does not grant <span class=\"bg3wiki-icont